  "composition_summary": "Preserved the volatile tail unchanged (single user request, no justified repair). The packet is pre-call with no observed provider capabilities, so no prompt fix is warranted. Drafted one pure-logic class-22 component pc-transfer-10: name/description/content only, no dependencies, no UUID, no prior Q1/Q2 approval. The body is executable Python at module scope: it reads each raw field with inputs.get (distinguishing absent from explicit null), validates exact integer semantics (rejecting bool/float/strings), enforces the 6..15 range, and assigns result on every branch without raise, coercion or defaults. The invalid-result object contains only its declared fields. Typed inputs remain a target interface requiring runner support; this is an unapproved draft, not an activated component. No observed tests, submission or activation occurred.",
